{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":401689,\"title\":\"Mythica: The Godslayer\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"As the Lich King's zombie legions ravage the world, a cursed young sorceress embarks on a quest to obtain a weapon from the gods. But when she joins her sworn enemy in a desperate attempt to save the world, she must recover the good in herself before her friends are all dead, and defeat the Lich King before the gods are destroyed and the world forever enslaved.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a2RjGmJPfk3Wcb8wMoLe5dkxeMj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/soHvoglTiaErt3BpNCVawd58Dl5.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":71,\"year\":2016,\"runtime\":118,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"John Lyde\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":130791,\"name\":\"John Lyde\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3OqB073x5rbXNR9QZQXTd5qNLLo.jpg\"},{\"id\":1362313,\"name\":\"Melanie Stone\",\"character\":\"Marek\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eBIEWUr4zpQj0gQeIgvxnPCkN8n.jpg\"},{\"id\":107793,\"name\":\"Adam Johnson\",\"character\":\"Thane\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oFgiM8x3dGk2AQXI7RKcb6j1J7g.jpg\"},{\"id\":1418422,\"name\":\"Jake Stormoen\",\"character\":\"Dagen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Dep8AvpXVR0BPF0KdHz70pZHDn.jpg\"},{\"id\":930332,\"name\":\"Nicola Posener\",\"character\":\"Teela\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eTIb9FT6RJIUTBzdlM57haXdhRw.jpg\"},{\"id\":556275,\"name\":\"Matthew Mercer\",\"character\":\"Szorlok\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fe1S317253vfMuNuIDjhp9vtNSs.jpg\"},{\"id\":142184,\"name\":\"Bailee Michelle Johnson\",\"character\":\"Young Woman\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pA4wsTEfuAOGe1xBMrqwyDzs6RB.jpg\"},{\"id\":5248920,\"name\":\"Ethan Hunt\",\"character\":\"Young Man\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":550359,\"name\":\"Christopher Robin Miller\",\"character\":\"Hammerhead\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eMvNwYW3PnWZRvjASkJCyWZsX8m.jpg\"},{\"id\":1598153,\"name\":\"Cooper Johnson\",\"character\":\"Page\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b5iJPepVTt6hS114nInYBZ1KGQ5.jpg\"},{\"id\":1029840,\"name\":\"Clint Vanderlinden\",\"character\":\"General Argus\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f0unAFZRdGgecZGAosQg127JvVi.jpg\"},{\"id\":1521888,\"name\":\"Paris Warner\",\"character\":\"Zombie Girl\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ueXEGsMUf1JFZQeZeBG33sPiNgI.jpg\"},{\"id\":1179076,\"name\":\"James C. Morris\",\"character\":\"Anxious Peasant\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Mzh0BeSPH7pjN682XODLqLjZCf.jpg\"},{\"id\":2398945,\"name\":\"Randall Malin\",\"character\":\"Zombie Dad\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5248922,\"name\":\"James Martin\",\"character\":\"General Roghar\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5248926,\"name\":\"Andy Jones\",\"character\":\"Grim Peasant\",\"photo\":null}],\"franchise\":{\"name\":\"Mythica Collection\",\"parts\":[{\"id\":321068,\"title\":\"Mythica: A Quest for Heroes\",\"year\":2014,\"rating\":5.9},{\"id\":347096,\"title\":\"Mythica: The Darkspore\",\"year\":2015,\"rating\":5.7},{\"id\":370687,\"title\":\"Mythica: The Necromancer\",\"year\":2015,\"rating\":5.9},{\"id\":388191,\"title\":\"Mythica: The Iron Crown\",\"year\":2016,\"rating\":6},{\"id\":401689,\"title\":\"Mythica: The Godslayer\",\"year\":2016,\"rating\":6},{\"id\":1183999,\"title\":\"Mythica: Stormbound\",\"year\":2024,\"rating\":6.9}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":122,\"title\":\"The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ctiw6FZK4N36LmkjSklWEbuvlq9.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":122917,\"title\":\"The Hobbit: The Battle of the Five Armies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xT98tLqatZPQApyRmlPL12LtiWp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3UbaCMmqOd7mca4Y5DOzY2ZVTyX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following Smaug's attack on Laketown, Bilbo and the dwarves try to defend Erebor's mountain of treasure from others who claim it: the men of the ruined Laketown and the elves of Mirkwood. Meanwhile an army of Orcs led by Azog the Defiler is marching on Erebor, fueled by the rise of the dark lord Sauron. Dwarves, elves and men must unite, and the hope for Middle-Earth falls into Bilbo's hands.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13486,\"title\":\"The Scorpion King 2: Rise of a Warrior\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/osZ6HJJBPwptZLTXFYbGQ0Jc7WB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mFhz8N5lyficOCh9tA7pSebOdMw.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The heroic tale of young Mathayus and his relentless quest for justice against an evil and powerful villain, King Sargon. Mathayus faces heart-stopping tribulations during his adventurous, odds-defying trajectory toward his ultimate destiny: becoming the formidable warrior king of an ancient desert empire.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062829,\"title\":\"Dream Journey 3: The Land of Many Perfumes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pkCuRSkTfQHU0eJVCGem3mXvzMg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffSphpknfrmJ0rIPiC36Otkyp30.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the slaughter of the daughter country, the souls full of grievances are unwilling to reincarnate. Under the conspiracy of the old Beiming Kun, they are trapped among the villains. Only by absorbing the masculine soul can the body be maintained. At this time, Tang Seng and his apprentice were arriving here. After understanding the true situation of the daughter country, Tang Seng succeeded in transcending the story of the souls of the daughter country in order to understand and save them, despite the opposition of the disciples.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1257417,\"title\":\"Duyung: Legenda Aurora\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yx4tVPJo6fh6V0C7tKbPU0LovhX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bzp8QAj6DgK9oec3f9rWJbDu1u1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The return of the Mermaid Puteri, who asks Jimmy for help to save her daughter, Aurora, who has been caught by a group of fish thieves using an illegal trawler. Helped by Hamlau (daughter of the Mermaid Princess played by Zero), Dashmond, (Jimmy and Aspalela's son) embarks on an adventure to find Aurora. Their journey is filled with various funny things, because Hamlau and Aurora can only be on land for no more than six hours. They are also accompanied Ajaq (driver), and with the help of Ajaq they managed to save Aurora who was auctioned off to Dr. Evo. With the cunning and extraordinary strength of the mermaid warrior, they managed to get Aurora back. The story ends with the announcement of Dashmond wanting to marry Aurora.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"kU1ZtjWZML4\",\"name\":\"Mythica 5: The Godslayer - Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}